            <div type="edition" xml:space="preserve">
                <ab xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0"><div xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0" type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="I"><lb n="1"/>a-ke-se-to-ro | to pa-po p̣ạ-ṣị-ḷẹ-[wo-se  →</div><div xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0" type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="II"><lb n="1"/>ti-ṃọ-ke-re-to-se | e-mi |  ←</div></ab>
            </div>
            <div type="translation" xml:lang="DE" resp="Klaus Hallof"><ab xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0"><div xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0" type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="I"><lb/>(Schale) des Akestor, des Königs von Paphos.</div><div xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0" type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="II"><lb n="1"/>Ich bin (die Schale) des Timokres.</div></ab></div><div type="translation" xml:lang="GRC" resp=" "><ab xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0"><div xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0" type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="I"><lb n="1"/>Ἀκέστορο(ς) τῶ Πάφω β̣α̣σ̣ι̣λ̣ῆ̣[ϝος].</div><div xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0" type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="II"><lb n="1"/>Τιμοκρέτος ἠμί.</div></ab></div>
            <div type="bibliography">
